  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Climate Finance: Portfolio-level Monitoring, Evaluation, and Learning (ICF PMEL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this programme provides portfolio-level monitoring, evaluation and learning work on the cross-government ICF portfolio. It will enhance accountability and provide learning, and the high-quality evidence needed to inform current and future ICF strategy, policy and programme decision-making. It will contribute to wider HMG climate-related decision-making and improve the global evidence base to improve the value for money and impact of global ICF.</narrative>
  </description>
